<title>NETHERLANDS: Sales of 2007 Dutch state bond to close Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Sales of 2007 Dutch state bond to close Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch Finance Ministry said tap sales of the government's new 5.75 percent bond due February 2007 would close on Wednesday, the third day of sales, at 1600 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
